Error [E0205]: a read `SharedGuard` cannot enter a write helper
  --> tests/ui/shared_guard_read_write_helper.jet:8:11
    |
  8 |     bump(&guard)
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: the helper can edit through this parameter, so its caller must hold an exclusive Shared guard
 Fix: create the guard with `guard_edit()` before passing it with `&`
